1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:02:00,000
What if I told you that some of the greatest heroes in the Bible reached a point where they felt completely crushed by discouragement?

2
00:02:00,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Number one. Talk to your soul, do not just listen to it. Psalm 42:5

3
00:04:30,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Number two. God does not abandon you in the valley. Isaiah 41:10

4
00:07:00,000 --> 00:09:30,000
Number three. Your pain is producing something eternal. 2 Corinthians 4:16-18

5
00:09:30,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Number four. Yesterday's failure does not cancel today's mercy. Lamentations 3:22-23

6
00:12:00,000 --> 00:14:30,000
Number five. God moves closest when your heart is broken. Psalm 34:18

7
00:14:30,000 --> 00:17:00,000
Number six. You were never meant to carry everything alone. Matthew 11:28

8
00:17:00,000 --> 00:19:30,000
Number seven. Praise is a weapon before the breakthrough. Romans 15:13

9
00:19:30,000 --> 00:20:00,000
Let us pray. Lord, You see every heavy heart watching right now...

